{"title":"AI on your server","description":"Choose where AI runs for your self-hosted server and which AI capabilities your users get.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>AI on your server</h1>\n<p>AI is off by default in every image. For what users can do with AI, see <a href=\"/Tools/Guides/AI-Assistant/\">AI assistant</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"choose-where-ai-runs\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Choose where AI runs<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#choose-where-ai-runs\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><ol>\n<li>Sign in as an administrator and open <strong>Settings → Server → AI Engine</strong>.</li>\n<li>Under <strong>Connection</strong>, choose an option.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Save Changes</strong>, then <strong>Restart Now</strong>. For your own engine on <code>latest-fat</code>, restart the container instead, because <strong>Restart Now</strong> does not start the bundled engine.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"/img/ai/connection-modes.png\" alt=\"AI connection settings with Off, Run your own engine, and Use Stirling Cloud AI\"></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th>What it means</th>\n<th>Set it up</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Off</strong></td>\n<td>No AI tools anywhere in the app, and nothing leaves this server.</td>\n<td>Default</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Run your own engine</strong></td>\n<td>An AI engine you host, using a model provider you choose, such as Claude, GPT or a local model. You hold the keys and pay the provider.</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Server/AI/Run-the-AI-Engine/\">Run the AI engine</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Use Stirling Cloud AI</strong></td>\n<td>No engine, provider key or model choice. AI runs on Stirling Cloud and is billed to the Stirling account this server is linked to.</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Server/AI/Use-Stirling-Cloud-AI/\">Use Stirling Cloud AI from your server</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Without an Enterprise licence, AI tools count against the server's monthly <a href=\"/Server/Licensing/Connect-to-Stirling-Cloud/#processing-allowance\">processing allowance</a>, even with your own engine and provider key.</p>\n<p>For what each option sends off the server, see <a href=\"/Server/AI/AI-Security/\">AI security</a>.</p>\n<p>The settings page needs login enabled; otherwise set <code>aiEngine.enabled</code> and <code>aiEngine.mode</code> in <code>settings.yml</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"config-methods\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-0\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"settings\" aria-selected=\"true\">Settings File</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"env\" aria-selected=\"false\">Environment Variable</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"settings\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">aiEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELF_HOSTED</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"env\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AIENGINE_ENABLED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AIENGINE_MODE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELF_HOSTED</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<h2 id=\"turn-capabilities-on-or-off\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Turn capabilities on or off<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#turn-capabilities-on-or-off\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>All six capabilities are on by default. To turn one off, switch it off under <strong>Capabilities</strong> on the same page, then save and restart. Capabilities that are off are hidden in the app.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Capability</th>\n<th>Setting</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Chat assistant</strong></td>\n<td><code>aiEngine.features.chat</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Document questions</strong></td>\n<td><code>aiEngine.features.documentQuestions</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Create PDF from prompt</strong></td>\n<td><code>aiEngine.features.createPdf</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Math auditor</strong></td>\n<td><code>aiEngine.features.mathAuditor</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>PDF comment agent</strong></td>\n<td><code>aiEngine.features.pdfComment</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Document classification</strong></td>\n<td><code>aiEngine.features.classify</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>For example, to turn off PDF creation:</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"config-methods\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-1\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"settings\" aria-selected=\"true\">Settings File</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"env\" aria-selected=\"false\">Environment Variable</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"settings\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">aiEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  features</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    createPdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"env\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AIENGINE_FEATURES_CREATEPDF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">false</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Conversation stays available while either <strong>Chat assistant</strong> or <strong>Document questions</strong> is on. Turn both off to disable it.</li>\n<li>Processor <a href=\"/Processor/Policies/Classification/\">Classification</a> needs <strong>Document classification</strong>. To route documents without AI, use <a href=\"/Processor/Policies/Routing/\">Routing</a> rules on document properties.</li>\n<li><strong>Create PDF from prompt</strong> needs WeasyPrint on the Stirling PDF server. The standard and fat Docker images include it. On a JAR install, put <code>weasyprint</code> on the <code>PATH</code> or set <code>system.customPaths.operations.weasyprint</code> to its location.</li>\n<li>For AI tools used through MCP clients, see <a href=\"/Server/Automation/MCP-Server/\">MCP server settings</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Server/AI/AI.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#choose-where-ai-runs\">Choose where AI runs</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#turn-capabilities-on-or-off\">Turn capabilities on or off</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Server/Operations/Diagnostics/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Diagnostics</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Server/AI/Run-the-AI-Engine/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Run the AI engine</span>\n      </a>"}